SCOPE OF THE ABOVE

The MIT licence above covers only what the 1.6 port added, which here is
almost all of the shipped files:

  - the three patch files, rewritten: every class name they name had been
    renamed upstream, the Vikings guard named the wrong mod, the operations
    were regrouped so one failure no longer silences the rest, and the two
    dead target mods were followed into Vanilla Factions Expanded - Medieval 2
  - CompFireOverlaySouthExtinguishable.cs, rewritten on vanilla's
    CompFireOverlay
  - the packaging and the documentation

IT DOES NOT COVER THE ORIGINAL MOD. The choice of buildings to patch, and the
observation that Medieval Overhaul's stove and rustic hearth need a comp of
their own because their flame is drawn only facing north, are Keshash's:

  https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3109675320

They never declared a licence for it, so none is granted here and none can be.
It is redistributed under the usual practice for abandoned mods - explicit
credit, a link to the original, and removal on request.

If Keshash asks for this to be taken down, it comes down. Immediately, and
without discussion.

ATTRIBUTION.md records what was taken and what was changed.
